# Production deploy

- Never ask the user for SSH host, password, keys, or a one-off server login.
- After CI is green, deploy with
  `gh workflow run "Deploy production" --ref main`
  and watch `gh run watch`.
- Host, user, deploy key, public URL, and readiness token already live in the
  GitHub environment `production`.
- Do not print secrets, `.env.production`, or the deploy key.
- Do not SSH to production unless the user explicitly asks to debug the machine
  itself. A normal release is the workflow above.
